# Plays hole 1 of the test course from the tee to the cup, for a debug PRC
# built with EXTRA=-DPLAY_SEED=3 (a fixed wind, 13 mph). Start it on the
# tee view once it's drawn. Two swings at 95 % power with the snap on time
# (start on the strip, power at 950 ms, snap 712 ms later), then two putts
# with the power click past the meter's cup mark, as the IIIx plays them:
# a par. Times are multiples of 10 ms so the meter reads the same at any
# tick phase, and the power click stays clear of the meter's end, where a
# late tap turns into the snap. On the green it opens the map for the debug
# timings and comes back, before each putt.
# The drive.
0 pen-down 60 150
60 pen-up
700 snapshot "{out}/s1-meter.png"
950 pen-down 80 60
1010 pen-up
1660 pen-down 80 60
1720 pen-up
3500 snapshot "{out}/s1-flight.png"
6500 snapshot "{out}/s1-roll.png"
9000 snapshot "{out}/s1-result.png"
19000 snapshot "{out}/s2-aim.png"
# The approach.
20000 pen-down 60 150
20060 pen-up
20950 pen-down 80 60
21010 pen-up
21660 pen-down 80 60
21720 pen-up
23500 snapshot "{out}/s2-flight.png"
26500 snapshot "{out}/s2-roll.png"
28800 snapshot "{out}/s2-result.png"
38000 snapshot "{out}/p1-aim.png"
# The map, with the green view's draw time (S, ms) on its strip, and back.
38200 pen-down 148 155
38260 pen-up
39000 snapshot "{out}/p1-map.png"
39200 pen-down 80 60
39260 pen-up
# The first putt.
40000 pen-down 60 150
40060 pen-up
40400 snapshot "{out}/p1-meter.png"
40730 pen-down 80 60
40790 pen-up
41800 snapshot "{out}/p1-roll.png"
44400 snapshot "{out}/p1-result.png"
# The map again for the putting meter and roll frame times, and back.
47000 pen-down 148 155
47060 pen-up
48000 snapshot "{out}/p2-map.png"
48200 pen-down 80 60
48260 pen-up
51000 snapshot "{out}/p2-aim.png"
# The second, and in.
52000 pen-down 60 150
52060 pen-up
52390 pen-down 80 60
52450 pen-up
52900 snapshot "{out}/p2-roll.png"
53400 snapshot "{out}/p2-drop.png"
54300 snapshot "{out}/p2-result.png"
57000 snapshot "{out}/done.png"
